1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,300
The dashboard talks to a MIDI-GPT
server. It isn't running yet.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,086
Start it with the "Start MIDI-GPT
Server" shortcut on your Desktop.

3
00:00:12,286 --> 00:00:16,300
Keep this window open
while you use MIDI-GPT.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,014
The first start downloads the model,
which can take a few minutes.

5
00:00:26,214 --> 00:00:29,657
Back in the dashboard, click "Retry".

6
00:00:29,857 --> 00:00:35,657
The model picker fills in, and the
model's family is shown next to it.

7
00:00:35,857 --> 00:00:42,014
The server address is shown here.
"Change..." points it at another machine.

8
00:00:42,214 --> 00:00:46,371
To stop the server, press
Ctrl+C in its window.
